{
  "name": "Call every new HubSpot contact with a Ringee AI voice agent and log the call",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## HubSpot lead calling\nWhen a contact is created in HubSpot, an AI voice agent phones them. When the call ends, the call is logged on the HubSpot contact with the AI's summary.\n\nContacts need a **phone number** property. Only create contacts who agreed to be called.\n\n[Ringee](https://ringee.io) · [Docs](https://docs.ringee.io)",
        "height": 230,
        "width": 470,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "f795d8f5-6222-55c5-a21c-a7845c4fb399",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -260,
        -340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "**Before you run this**\n1. In Ringee, create a **Custom Integration** (Integrations → Custom Integrations) and copy its **API key** and **Signing Secret**.\n2. In n8n, create a **Ringee API** credential with both.\n3. Pick your AI voice agent in the Ringee node.\n4. Activate the workflow, then paste the **Ringee Trigger's Production URL** into the integration's **Outbound URL** and tick *Call Completed* and *Call Failed*.\n\nConnect **HubSpot** on the trigger and on the two HubSpot nodes. The HubSpot Trigger needs a HubSpot developer app; see n8n's HubSpot Trigger guide.",
        "height": 330,
        "width": 470,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "65078102-78fc-5728-a528-4003bfb9102d",
      "name": "Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -260,
        -90
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "**Consent and calling hours**\nOnly call people who agreed to be called, and only at reasonable hours. Ringee blocks numbers on your Do-Not-Call list and respects your plan's limits, but you are responsible for the permission to call. Every phone number in this template is fictional.",
        "height": 190,
        "width": 360,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "479b5afe-69a9-5f92-84df-972259c8b724",
      "name": "Consent",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        260,
        -340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "eventsUi": {
          "eventValues": [
            {
              "name": "contact.creation"
            }
          ]
        },
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "bdf1243f-5546-5b5d-a3c2-f2fa98ce698d",
      "name": "New HubSpot contact",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.hubspotTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        260,
        -100
      ],
      "webhookId": "a50f40b0-b84d-5329-8f14-8826a92131a7"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "oAuth2",
        "resource": "contact",
        "operation": "get",
        "contactId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "={{ $json.objectId }}",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "additionalFields": {
          "propertiesCollection": {
            "propertiesValues": {
              "properties": [
                "firstname",
                "lastname",
                "phone",
                "mobilephone",
                "email"
              ],
              "propertyMode": "valueOnly"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "b4247147-1713-5368-a1f3-1a741e1f533a",
      "name": "Get contact details",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.hubspot",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        500,
        -100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "d8323019-fba2-5bcf-b36a-8df089200732",
              "name": "phone",
              "value": "={{ (() => { const p = $json.properties || {}; const v = x => (x && typeof x === 'object' && 'value' in x) ? x.value : x; return String(v(p.phone) || v(p.mobilephone) || '').trim(); })() }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "bf35c9a7-aee2-5481-a5c1-6a45eeefb28f",
              "name": "firstName",
              "value": "={{ (() => { const p = $json.properties || {}; const v = x => (x && typeof x === 'object' && 'value' in x) ? x.value : x; return v(p.firstname) || 'there'; })() }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "1eb01138-9d2a-53e3-98c4-e29e8a913439",
              "name": "lastName",
              "value": "={{ (() => { const p = $json.properties || {}; const v = x => (x && typeof x === 'object' && 'value' in x) ? x.value : x; return v(p.lastname) || ''; })() }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "7aa7fa87-776d-5a00-aa7f-9615ebac6dde",
              "name": "contactId",
              "value": "={{ $json.vid || $json.id }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "6ef02965-ba38-5c28-b368-1420933819c3",
      "name": "Prepare lead",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.5,
      "position": [
        740,
        -100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "573dbe31-ea9d-5120-b4df-6600aa71ed5d",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.phone }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "163a7431-ffea-506c-8c74-0f1f7cac5af2",
      "name": "Has a phone number?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        980,
        -100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "aiAgent",
        "operation": "startCall",
        "agentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "phoneNumber": "={{ $json.phone }}",
        "variables": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "first_name": "={{ $json.firstName }}",
            "last_name": "={{ $json.lastName }}",
            "reason": "You were added to our contacts and we wanted to introduce ourselves"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": [],
          "attemptToConvertTypes": false,
          "convertFieldsToString": false
        },
        "options": {
          "externalId": "={{ 'hs-' + $json.contactId }}",
          "idempotencyKey": "={{ 'hs-' + $json.contactId }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "43e936bd-3deb-57e5-bdcf-15ebf859138f",
      "name": "Start the call",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-ringee.ringee",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1220,
        -180
      ],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "e682c51d-73d0-51ce-8da2-a41c97cd46be",
      "name": "No phone number: skipped",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "events": [
          "call.completed",
          "call.failed"
        ],
        "options": {
          "onlyAiAgentCalls": true,
          "externalIdPrefix": "hs-"
        }
      },
      "id": "a7941df1-fd37-51c8-883b-61f47ed542c0",
      "name": "Call ended",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-ringee.ringeeTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        260,
        240
      ],
      "webhookId": "b6a0ba00-6412-5244-8c85-ee9735132b00"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": 2,
        "unit": "minutes"
      },
      "id": "b7c1315f-fa27-51ee-b91e-62f84b242ad9",
      "name": "Wait for the AI analysis",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        500,
        240
      ],
      "webhookId": "ebb9b9c0-f3fa-5c6b-a4fc-3189422d166f"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "aiAgent",
        "operation": "getCallResult",
        "callId": "={{ $('Call ended').item.json.data.call?.voiceAgentCall?.id || $('Call ended').item.json.data.agentCallId }}"
      },
      "id": "22343c9a-4182-5651-850d-06975e9bb61e",
      "name": "Get call result",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-ringee.ringee",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        740,
        240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "oAuth2",
        "resource": "engagement",
        "operation": "create",
        "type": "call",
        "metadata": {
          "body": "={{ 'AI voice agent call. Outcome: ' + ($json.outcome || ($json.status === 'completed' ? 'analysis pending' : $json.status)) + '. ' + ($json.summary || '') }}",
          "durationMilliseconds": "={{ ($('Call ended').item.json.data.durationSeconds || 0) * 1000 }}",
          "fromNumber": "={{ $('Call ended').item.json.data.fromNumber }}",
          "toNumber": "={{ $('Call ended').item.json.data.toNumber }}",
          "status": "={{ ({ completed: 'COMPLETED', busy: 'BUSY', failed: 'FAILED', voicemail: 'NO_ANSWER', no_answer: 'NO_ANSWER' })[$json.status] || 'NO_ANSWER' }}"
        },
        "additionalFields": {
          "associations": {
            "contactIds": "={{ $('Call ended').item.json.data.externalId.replace('hs-', '') }}"
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "3a58d55a-5c61-536f-a13b-a4dc3a707d56",
      "name": "Log the call in HubSpot",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.hubspot",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        980,
        240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "de74d81c-f8fd-517f-ae71-7966d408b832",
      "name": "Call not placed: see the error",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1460,
        -20
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "430b0d5b-6733-5958-9cf9-3e923dad1d0c",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.outcome }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "857f3f5b-eb40-5f2d-a2ca-7b2cb617c911",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.status }}",
              "rightValue": "failed",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "or"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e8068268-6ef3-5ba1-936a-a3423ca3f49e",
      "name": "Analysis ready?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        980,
        240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": 5,
        "unit": "minutes"
      },
      "id": "21d22578-9f64-5290-8439-c9682ea49491",
      "name": "Wait 5 more minutes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        980,
        460
      ],
      "webhookId": "4978e037-8fb0-51df-98d8-8e9a423681b1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "aiAgent",
        "operation": "getCallResult",
        "callId": "={{ $('Call ended').item.json.data.call?.voiceAgentCall?.id || $('Call ended').item.json.data.agentCallId }}"
      },
      "id": "fe6b17a7-900b-53db-9a27-f3175ea88ec6",
      "name": "Get call result (second try)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-ringee.ringee",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1220,
        460
      ]
    }
  ],
